  "elements": [
    {"id":"title","type":"text","x":44,"y":30,"width":860,"height":38,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":73001,"version":1,"versionNonce":83001,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Nets are folding plans. 2D drawings are finished views.","fontSize":30,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Nets are folding plans. 2D drawings are finished views.","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"subtitle","type":"text","x":46,"y":76,"width":920,"height":24,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":73002,"version":1,"versionNonce":83002,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Do not just count faces. Use the three-question gate, then prove the picture works.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Do not just count faces. Use the three-question gate, then prove the picture works.","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"gate","type":"rectangle","x":44,"y":118,"width":1092,"height":86,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#b45309","backgroundColor":"#fef3c7","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":3,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["gate"],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":73101,"version":1,"versionNonce":83101,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},
    {"id":"gate_text","type":"text","x":70,"y":145,"width":1010,"height":52,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["gate"],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":73102,"version":1,"versionNonce":83102,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Three-question gate: 1. What view is this?  2. Does the face kit match?  3. Can it fold or draw correctly?\nflat / folded / drawing     right shapes + count     no gaps / no overlap","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Three-question gate: 1. What view is this?  2. Does the face kit match?  3. Can it fold or draw correctly?\nflat / folded / drawing     right shapes + count     no gaps / no overlap","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"flow","type":"text","x":54,"y":244,"width":1080,"height":190,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["flow"],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":73201,"version":1,"versionNonce":83201,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"1. Flat net = before folding\nA net is a face map. A shared edge is a hinge. face kit: 6 squares. shared edge = hinge\n\n2. Fold test = one face, one slot\nfront, back, top, bottom, left, right. Valid: every face gets one place. Fail: two faces land in the same slot.\n\n3. 2D drawing = after folding\nShows depth, not every face. hidden edges still exist. Real faces are still squares or rectangles.","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"1. Flat net = before folding\nA net is a face map. A shared edge is a hinge. face kit: 6 squares. shared edge = hinge\n\n2. Fold test = one face, one slot\nfront, back, top, bottom, left, right. Valid: every face gets one place. Fail: two faces land in the same slot.\n\n3. 2D drawing = after folding\nShows depth, not every face. hidden edges still exist. Real faces are still squares or rectangles.","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"traps","type":"rectangle","x":54,"y":636,"width":1082,"height":158,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#93c5fd","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["traps"],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":73301,"version":1,"versionNonce":83301,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},
    {"id":"trap_text","type":"text","x":82,"y":664,"width":1000,"height":108,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#dc2626","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["traps"],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":73302,"version":1,"versionNonce":83302,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Single-row trap: six correct faces can still be arranged wrongly. It makes a belt, not a box. face kit passes; fold test fails.\n\nSlot ledger = one face per slot. PASS: front top bottom left right back. FAIL: slot collision; top used twice; back missing.\nface kit passes, slot ledger fails.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Single-row trap: six correct faces can still be arranged wrongly. It makes a belt, not a box. face kit passes; fold test fails.\n\nSlot ledger = one face per slot. PASS: front top bottom left right back. FAIL: slot collision; top used twice; back missing.\nface kit passes, slot ledger fails.","lineHeight":1.25}
